     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "We Wonderland has a carousel-style canopy in Crazy Pink and Play Yellow, which gives it a fairground look. Under it are slides, a bridge, a climbing panel and a swing, all within 29'8\" x 15'1\", the smallest product area in our Play Lands range. That narrow footprint fits a society garden, a school courtyard or a restaurant play corner. Key users are 3 to 9 years and the age group starts at 3, so it is pitched at younger children. The safe play area is 35'8\" x 21'1\" and the listed capacity is 15. Warranty cover runs for 3 years on the galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Share the size of your space and we will send a layout drawing."
